      "message": "This will break the unit tests for `helipilot`, `buccaneer`, and `gwendolin`.\n\nWhy you do not add defaults to the binman similar to what was done [npcx_evb_npcx9m6f.dts](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/boards/nuvoton/npcx_evb/npcx_evb_npcx9m6f.dts) or what we do for [helipilot](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/fpmcu/helipilot/helipilot.dts;l\u003d42?q\u003dhelipilot.dts\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch#:~:text\u003d41-,42,-43), or simply override the `CONFIG_CROS_EC_RO_SIZE` in your `proj.conf`. This change was done 5 months ago and I am not sure what else it might break.",
